    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/car-rental-service/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Car Rental Service theme is a sleek, modern, and user-friendly solution designed for car rental companies, vehicle hire agencies, transport businesses, and travel operators offering services such as electric car rental, luxury car hire, holiday car rental, business car rental, corporate vehicle hire, exotic car rentals, SUV hire, airport rentals, budget car booking, chauffeur services, one-way rentals, self-drive options, wedding transport, and road trip vehicle hire. With its responsive, retina-ready, and mobile-friendly design, it delivers high-quality visuals and a seamless browsing experience across devices while ensuring fast-loading and SEO-optimized pages. This theme makes it simple to highlight car rental deals, discounts, weekend offers, pricing tables, loyalty programs, pickup and drop-off locations, and a wide vehicle fleet in a professional and engaging way. Built with clean and secure code on Bootstrap, it offers customization options for layouts, banners, testimonial sliders, rental calendars, and call-to-action buttons to boost conversions. It supports integration with GPS tracking, rental policies, insurance options, payment gateways, and multilingual functionality for global reach. With built-in shortcodes and personalization features, businesses can tailor the site to their branding needs without technical complexity. Compatible with the Car Rental Booking System plugin for customizable booking forms, real-time availability checks, and secure online reservations, along with Contact Form 7 for inquiries and WooCommerce for add-on services, the Car Rental Service theme empowers agencies to provide a reliable, professional, and modern online vehicle reservation platform."
    },
